<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies six muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies six muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Connecticut, $150 million general obligation bonds.  </p>
<p>--Washington County, Md., $7.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Lee County, N.C., $25 million GO school bonds.</p>
<p>--Pennsylvania, $358 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Onalaska, Wis., $2.65 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Washington County, Wis., $4.69 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
